# A chapter's brand lives in its bucket, never in git: brand/ commits only the example and the
# two shared files (CI's assert-brand-example-only fails any other addition)
brand-assets/
brand-init-answers.json
# Generated from the selected profile by `pnpm brand:apply` (prepare runs it on install)
.firebaserc
# Anchored with a leading slash: knip reads an unanchored brand/* as matching packages/brand/*
/brand/*
!/brand/example/
!/brand/brand.schema.json
!/brand/bucket-lifecycle.json
# Temporary: JCI Oriente deploys from its committed profile until the removal PR deletes it
!/brand/jci-oriente/
